  "description": "Convention-based dependency injection for .NET using Scrutor. Automatically register services by implementing marker interfaces (IScopedLifetime, ITransientLifetime, ISingletonLifetime) - no manual registration needed. Works with ASP.NET Core, Blazor, Worker Services, and any .NET app using DI.",
